# Omens' edges. The offer's operands, each false alone (An Empty Vessel completed for all: its 78 answers Waoud's nil):
# bob: Beginnings not completed (and no Immortal Sentries: Beginnings not offered either): 78; carl: a Warrior: 78; dan:
# a level 49 Blue Mage: 78, also at AF2_QUEST_LEVEL 49.4 (a number). ed (all met): Omens' mustZone set (a GM: the zone id 50): Waoud nil: 78; out and back (the
# mustZone cleared), Timer = now + 1 (a GM): nil: 78; Timer = now: 710. Main (accepted by a GM, 500 gil): Prog 0 711
# (500), option 1: under 1000 gil: nothing; Prog 1 (a GM): Lathuya nil: 770; Prog 2 (a GM): 713 (500), option 1:
# nothing; blank_omens Prog 2: nil: NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY; Prog 4 (a GM): Waoud nil: 78; Lathuya 716 with a full bag:
# quest:complete false (the charuqs do not fit): nothing, the envelope kept; room again: 716: completed.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Waoud/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/Lathuya/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/711 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/713 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/716 AydeewaSubterrane/blank_omens/onTrigger
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=67.116,-6,-78.222 job=BLU lvl=50 gil=500
char bob zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=67.116,-6,-78.222 job=BLU lvl=50 gil=5000
char carl zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=67.116,-6,-78.222 job=WAR lvl=50 gil=5000
char dan zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=67.116,-6,-78.222 job=BLU lvl=49 gil=5000
char ed zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=67.116,-6,-78.222 job=BLU lvl=50 gil=5000
quest AhtUrhgan.AnEmptyVessel completed
quest AhtUrhgan.Beginnings completed
quest AhtUrhgan.Omens accepted
